  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-Mec 306.03 Initial Apprentice Registration Licenses. The board shall issue apprentice registration licenses to those individuals who:\n\n(a) Enter into an agreement between the employer / master plumber to work under an approved plumbing apprenticeship program meeting the requirements of the state apprenticeship council;\n\n(b) Complete the board's apprentice / trainee registration form; and\n\n(c) Pay the fee specified in Saf-Mec 501.02.\n\nSource. #10648, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 7-25-14, EXPIRES: 1-21-15; ss by #10761, INTERIM, eff 1-21-15, EXPIRES: 7-20-15; ss by #10847, eff 7-1-15",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-mec300.html"
